Revision history for Game-Mahjong

0.02    2026-10-09
	- Fix: t/32 failed on one perl 5.14.2 smoker, where output captured
	  through an in-memory handle came back undecoded.
	- Fix: the number under a tile threw a DIFFERENT tile. The rack moves
	  the tile just drawn to the end and numbers what it drew; the parser
	  indexed the unreordered hand.
	- Point at the tile you mean: the arrow keys walk your rack and the
	  line under it says how far the throw leaves you from a win and how
	  many kinds would help.
	- Fix: the tile you may claim lost its <> marker with colour off, so
	  it looked like every other tile in the pool.
	- Fix: a bad --level or --seat died with a Perl file and line and exit
	  25; a refused option printed the usage to stdout.

0.01    2026-09-24
	First version
